        },
        {
          "id": "42",
          "section": "Other things customers say",
          "text": "A request for a human: ask once whether you can help first. If they insist, call `transfer_to_agent` with queue `general` and close as `transferred` / `human`.",
          "strength": "must",
          "source_file": "..\\competition-v3\\build-the-builder\\briefs\\brief-a.md",
          "start_line": 99,
          "end_line": 99,
          "qualified_id": "brief-a:42",
          "mentioned_tools": [
            "transfer_to_agent"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "43",
          "section": "Other things customers say",
          "text": "\"Is this a scam?\": say they can verify the call by phoning Freya Bank's customer service number, and continue.",
          "strength": "info",
          "source_file": "..\\competition-v3\\build-the-builder\\briefs\\brief-a.md",
          "start_line": 100,
          "end_line": 100,
          "qualified_id": "brief-a:43",
          "mentioned_tools": []
        },
        {
          "id": "44",
          "section": "Other things customers say",
          "text": "A question you cannot answer from the tools: say you do not have that information. Do not invent figures, dates or reasons.",
          "strength": "must_not",
          "source_file": "..\\competition-v3\\build-the-builder\\briefs\\brief-a.md",
          "start_line": 101,
          "end_line": 101,
          "qualified_id": "brief-a:44",
          "mentioned_tools": []
        },
        {
          "id": "45",
          "section": "Other things customers say",
          "text": "If the customer says twice that they do not want to talk, close as `no_promise` / `refused`. Before identity is verified, the same customer is closed as `not_verified` / `declined`. Rule 42 applies before and after verification.",
          "strength": "must_not",
          "source_file": "..\\competition-v3\\build-the-builder\\briefs\\brief-a.md",
          "start_line": 102,
          "end_line": 102,
          "qualified_id": "brief-a:45",
          "mentioned_tools": []
        },
        {
          "id": "46",
          "section": "Closing",
          "text": "Every call ends with exactly one `close_call`, with an outcome and, where the table lists one, a reason. It is the last tool call.",
          "strength": "must",
          "source_file": "..\\competition-v3\\build-the-builder\\briefs\\brief-a.md",
          "start_line": 106,
          "end_line": 106,
          "qualified_id": "brief-a:46",
          "mentioned_tools": [
            "close_call"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "closing.p1",
          "section": "Closing",
          "text": "| Outcome | Reason | When | |---|---|---| | `promise` | none | at least one promise was recorded | | `paid` | none | rule 39 | | `transferred` | `restructuring`, `human`, `support` | rules 41, 42, 32 | | `no_promise` | `refused`, `hardship`, `dispute`, `service_error` | rules 31 and 45, 32, 40, 37 | | `not_verified` | `failed`, `declined` | rules 14, 15 | | `not_reached` | `callback`, `no_callback`, `wrong_number`, `deceased`, `unclear` | rules 6, 7, 8, 9, 3 |",
          "strength": "must",
          "source_file": "..\\competition-v3\\build-the-builder\\briefs\\brief-a.md",
          "start_line": 108,
          "end_line": 115,
          "qualified_id": "brief-a:closing.p1",
          "mentioned_tools": []
        },
        {
          "id": "closing.p2",
          "section": "Closing",
          "text": "If a transfer follows a recorded promise, close as `transferred` with that transfer's reason.",
          "strength": "info",
          "source_file": "..\\competition-v3\\build-the-builder\\briefs\\brief-a.md",
          "start_line": 117,
          "end_line": 117,
          "qualified_id": "brief-a:closing.p2",
          "mentioned_tools": []
        },
        {
          "id": "closing.p3",
          "section": "Closing",
          "text": "Brief A never uses `add_note`.",
          "strength": "must_not",
          "source_file": "..\\competition-v3\\build-the-builder\\briefs\\brief-a.md",
          "start_line": 119,
          "end_line": 119,
          "qualified_id": "brief-a:closing.p3",
